window.products.push({"id":436153,"name":"La Pastiche Water Lilies by Claude Monet Hand Painted Oil on Canvas with Athenian Silver Frame, 29\" x 25\", Multi-Color","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":263.15,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81S9Cgz-uxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description 20\" X 24\" Oil Painting On Canvas Hand painted oil reproduction of a famous Monet painting, Water Lilies. The original masterpieces were created between 1914 and 1917. During these years, Monet's cataracts got progressively worse but that seemed to have little effect on his sense of color and harmony. Today it has been carefully recreated detail-by-detail, color-by-color to near perfection. Why settle for a print when you can add sophistication to your rooms with a beautiful fine gallery reproduction oil painting? While Monet successfully captured life's reality in many of his works, his aim was to analyze the ever-changing nature of color and light. Known as the classic Impressionist, Monet cannot help but inspire deep admiration for his talent in those who view his work. This work of art has the same emotions and beauty as the original. Why not grace your home with this reproduced masterpiece? It is sure to bring many admirers! Frame Description: Rococo Silver From the Manufacturer OverstockArt is an art manufacturer of framed hand painted oil reproductions and canvas art prints. overstockArt was among the earliest online galleries of hand painted oil paintings and the first to focus on art reproductions of great masters such as Van Gogh, Monet and Klimt. From Impressionist art to Modern Art, overstockArt has the perfect framed canvas art for your home. At overstockArt, we live and breathe the oil paintings that surround us and feel we have a special connection with our customers. Put simply, we are art lovers serving art lovers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81S9Cgz-uxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"overstockArt","source_asin":"B01M25T3XT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-436153","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M25T3XT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M25T3XT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
