window.products.push({"id":436183,"name":"150 PCS Air Fryer Disposable Paper Liner, AHYS 7.9 Inches Non-stick Disposable Air Fryer Liners for 5-7QT, Baking Paper for Air Fryer Oil-proof, Water","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61c+XkFpVNL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"WHAT YOU GET: 150 pcs 7.9 inches non-stick disposable air fryer liners for 5-7QT air fryers. Enough quantity to provide a wide choice and meet your daily needs for cooking, baking and replacement. CONVENIENT: The non-stick air fryer disposable paper liner are designed with a round bowl shape. No tools needed. You don’t need to tear, fold, cut, bend etc. You can directly put it into your air fryer or microwave when you are ready to cook. KEEP CLEAN: Baking paper liners are perfect choice if you hate cleaning after you finish frying. It keeps your fryer clean, and you don't need to rinse off any substitutable bowls. Simply throw away the used liner after you finished using them. Height 4.5cm can protect the side of fryers and prevent food from sticking to them. RELIABLE and ECO-FRIENDLY: Food-grade parchment paper liner made of natural wood pulp, no fluorescent agent added and non-toxic, non-stick, with nice heat resistant. Air fryer paper liners heat safe up to 428℉(220℃), make your air fryer parchment paper liners intact during cooking, and it has no effect on the taste of food. WARM TIPS: Never put empty baking paper liners in the air fryer. During pre-heating, please put enough food to weighed down the liners, if the food is too little, or too light, the liner is liable to fly up into the heating element, which may cause it to burn. VERSATILITY: Suitable for air fryer, microwave oven, oven, steamer etc. The parchment paper liners can be used for baking, frying or holding food, and is a very practical tool when out camping, barbecuing, summer parties and so on.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61c+XkFpVNL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AHYS","source_asin":"B09VSZ7XMD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-436183","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VSZ7XMD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VSZ7XMD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
