window.products.push({"id":436239,"name":"Bathroom Rug Sets 3 Piece, Ultra Shaggy Soft Bath Rugs, Non Slip Washable Chenille Bath Mat, Absorbent Bathroom Carpet, Long Microfiber Plush Bathmat ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vX1-IEorS._AC_SL1475_.jpg","description":"🌼ULTRA SOFT & SHAGGY: Our luxurious shag rug is made of 1.2 inches polyester microfiber shags that be soft and fluffy enough like sinking into a deep shag pile while you step on it. Every time you step on this mat, you can enjoy superior comfort, protect your feet from the cold floor at the same time it protects your floor from moisture. 🌼Useful 3-PIECE RUG SET: 1 U-Shape Contoured Rug 20\"x20\", this U-shaped mat can fits perfectly to most contour toilet. Other 16\"x24\" & 20\"x32\" rectangular mats are multifunctional, can be widely used for bathroom, living room, home decor, floating window, under the chair, pet Mat, in front of sink,vanity. More than just a floor mat! These rugs can easily match your home, add warmth and flavor to any part of your house. 🌼SUPERIOR WATER ABSORBENCY: The bath mat is consist of 3 layers, the top 1 inch long individual microfiber pile layer ; the middle layer is filled with sponge; the bottom is a PVC non-skid layer. This three-layer structure makes our bathroom has better water absorption performance of than other material mats. 🌼ANTI-SLIP & ANTI-SKID: With the new technology hot melt adhesive and rough layer on backingand, this rugs have strong grip, can stay in place even in slippery bathroom. Perfect bathroom rugs prevent shifting or slipping, ensure the safety of you and your family to a much greater extent. 🌼WASHABLE RUGS SAVING YOUR TIME: Constructed of high-grade materials, you can trust our durable mats. For simply care, you may shake the carpet or use a vacuum. For a deeper clean, just toss it in the washing machine and dryer. Care instructions: Machine wash cold with like colors, gentle cycle, use mild soap. When needed, rinse thoroughly in cold water, tumble dry low, stretch and reshape after removal foam dryer. 🌼Five colors to choose from: Dark gray, Camel, Light gray, Burgundy, Coffee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vX1-IEorS._AC_SL1475_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HTHOOOOOME","source_asin":"B0956YP27X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-436239","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0956YP27X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0956YP27X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":436240,"name":"Stainless Steel Animal Wine Aerator & Liquor Pourer (Penguin) - 9 Designs Available!","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rS7o7I0EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We believe in using the highest quality materials to make the highest quality product on the market. Instead of using a cheaper, commonly used zinc alloy, we use stainless steel with a custom antique finish. All of our pourers are individually handcrafted and tested to ensure satisfaction. Why does exposing your wine to air make it taste better? Wine is made up of hundreds of compounds, and with aeration, usually the volatile and undesirable compounds will evaporate more quickly than the enjoyable, aromatic and flavorful ones. When using one of our pourers, the process takes effect immediately allowing you to simply enjoy the benefits of aeration without having to wait! Aerate your wine with style and choose your favorite animal to liven up the party! Nobody likes a boring pourer... Making a difference one pourer at a time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rS7o7I0EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Wildly Refined Collection","source_asin":"B09M4QSH9X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-436240","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09M4QSH9X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09M4QSH9X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
