window.products.push({"id":436273,"name":"TeQsli Folding Mattress Queen, Gel Memory Foam Portable Tri-Fold Mattress Topper 4 Inch with Washable Bamboo Cover, Non-Slip Bottom, Breathable Mesh S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":149.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vAckIQ3IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Considerate Construction】 TEQSLI tri-fold mattress queen features a 2-layer design. The upper layer is made of 1-inch gel memory foam, while the lower layer is 3-inch medium-density support foam. The breathable mesh sides help control the overall temperature of the mattress; the skid-resistant base prevents sliding; the metal zipper for convenient disassembly. 【Pressure Relief & Comfortable】 The 4-inch folding mattress easily accommodates your sleeping style and ensures you a good night’s sleep. The gel memory foam distributes body pressure evenly according to different pressure points and allows for continuous air circulation and heat dissipation inside the mattress. 【Compact & Convenient】 The lightweight trifold memory foam mattress is foldable and movable, easy to carry around, set up and just takes up little space in your house. When folded, it can serve as a sofa neatly tucked in a corner of your house, offering you comfortable support and a cushy feeling. 【Multi-Purpose Mattress】 TEQSLI portable tri-folding mattress folds and unfolds easily. It is great for games, camping, travel, living rooms, playrooms, dorm rooms, yoga, etc. As an ideal guest bed and floor sofa, its minimalist style is a perfect match for your home decor. 【Guaranteed】 TEQSLI CertiPUR-US certified queen mattress comes with a 10-year warranty. Please feel free to contact us if you have any questions. 72 hours is recommended for the mattress to fully expand. 🔔Gel memory foam is temperature-sensitive. It takes more time to fully unfold at a low temperature. 【Note】We know that everyone's sleep experience is different, and the teqsli folding mattress may be a little soft for adults.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vAckIQ3IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TeQsli","source_asin":"B09MB2HMNX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-436273","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MB2HMNX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MB2HMNX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":436274,"name":"Wilton Ice Cube and Treat Bone Silicone Mold Tray 12 Cavities","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HjGujogFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The 12-cavity silicone tray is perfect for dog bones, dog treats, drink ice cubes, cakes, gelatin shots, anything your imagination can think of! Use this fun shaped silicone mold to chill party ice cubes, mold gelatin, ice cream or candy, or bake cookies or mini cakes, and homemade dog treats and bones! Little goblins will love using this 12-cavity mold to transform treats into skeleton bones. Or, use it to mold shaped ice cubes to add a creepy look to drinks at a party! you can even make cute bone cookies for a puppy party! always place mold on level baking sheet for easy positioning and removal from oven, refrigerator or freezer. When baking, for best results, spray baking surface with non-stick spray. Silicone mold is heat resistant to 500 degree Fahrenheit and can also withstand changes to temperature, such as moving from freezer directly to oven. Dishwasher safe. Made by Wilton!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HjGujogFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wilton","source_asin":"B00KKV3R18","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-436274","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KKV3R18","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KKV3R18","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
