window.products.push({"id":436371,"name":"Levtex Home - Bay Islands Quilt Set - King/Cal King Quilt + Two King Pillow Shams - Coral, Teal, Gold, Taupe - Quilt (106x92in.) and Pillow Shams (36x","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":159.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91D+ItfQXZS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Cotton THE BAY ISLANDS DESIGN: One of our most popular quilt sets, Bay Islands is inspired by the colors of a coral reef, with an a colorful coastal collection of coral and shells front and a charming reverse pattern of light blue gate pattern on cream. A bound border provides contrast and texture to complete the look. SOFT AND COMFORTABLE LUXURY: Made from the softest rayon, reversing to cotton and filled with a cotton rich filler (90% cotton, 7% rayon, 3% other fibers), this quilt will never feel heavy, stiff or uncomfortable. The Bay Islands quilt and pillow sham set has an ultra soft feel that you'll simply love. Our quilt is very generously sized to give your bedroom a feeling of comfort and luxury. EASY CARE: Pre washed for your convenience, the Bay Islands quilt and pillow sham set is easy to look after. Simply machine wash on a cold, gentle cycle, then line dry or tumble dry at low temperature. COORDINATE YOUR ROOM DECOR: Create a wonderful bedroom space with our coordinated reversible matching bed set. The coral, teal, gold and taupe design brings the feeling of soothing coastal breezes into your home and will match a variety of different looks and bedroom decor. You can also freshen your room with other items from the Levtex Home collection.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91D+ItfQXZS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Levtex Home","source_asin":"B08CMM9V87","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-436371","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CMM9V87","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CMM9V87","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
