window.products.push({"id":436407,"name":"Bamboo Steamer for Cooking 10” -by DoSensePro Includes 2 Tiers, Stainless Steel Dumpling Maker, Liners, Chopsticks, Ceramic Dish, and Bamboo Tongs. Du","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Nbsiyq24L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ULTIMATE STEAMER BASKET SET – The DoSensePro dumpling steam basket is including all the bamboo steamer accessories you need to cook and serve your favorite dishes: two chopsticks sets, one sauce dish, bamboo tongs and 20pcs parchment paper liners so that food won't stick! We also include stainless steel 2 pieces DUMPLING DOUGH MAKER SET. The natural bamboo steamer is the perfect addition to your kitchen, you'll never want to cook dinner again without it. NATURAL HEALTHY FOOD - With the help of a bamboo steamer and dumpling maker cooking has become a fun family experience that everyone can enjoy together! Our steam basket bamboo is made of bamboo, which is a natural material. The bamboo steamer is a healthy way to cook your food because it retains the natural flavor and nutrients of your favorite foods while eliminating the unhealthy oils that are often found in fried foods. HIGH-QUALITY DESIGN AND MATERIAL - Our Bamboo Steamer is made of 100% organic bamboo, which makes it not only eco-friendly and sustainable but also super healthy. The Bamboo steamer basket is made of high-quality bamboo which will last you years to come. Bamboo cooker is easy to use, easy to clean, and its design is very practical. Chinese food steamer is the perfect tool for people who love all types of cuisine. 100% EVEN COOKING - Our dim sum dumpling steamer has water-resistant walls and the dome-shaped lids on bamboo baskets don't allow condensation to accumulate, so you can enjoy healthy food. The firmware design ensures that heat is distributed evenly. With our premium bamboo steamer, you don't have to worry about what you want for dinner anymore, steamer cooking versatility allows you to cook dumplings, vegetables, seafood, fish, meat, dim sum and, everything else from Asian traditional cuisine. 2-TIER BAMBOO STEAMER – Our bamboo steamer basket has a 10” diameter and 3” depth of each tier. The two-tier design allows you to steam a large amount of food in one go. It also allows for more cooking options than traditional steamers. Cook two servings simultaneously! Stackable layers allow for easy separation of ingredients.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Nbsiyq24L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DoSensePro","source_asin":"B08ZYQG997","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-436407","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZYQG997","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZYQG997","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
