window.products.push({"id":436427,"name":"Toaster 2 Slice Wide Slot Toaster Best Rated Prime Displav Smart Toasters with LCD Digital Countdown Timer and Bagel/Defrost/Cancel/Reheat Function","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zBIxbZm5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you still worried about the busy breakfast preparation? Are you still feeling bummed by the lack of crispy toast for breakfast? Now, It’s Time to Make a Delicious Breakfast by Adding a Black Toaster for you and your Family!And it also will be first apartment necessities.Smart Toaster 2 slice with Digital Countdown Timer, make you have more choices, more flavors. Make Perfect Breakfast In Few Minutes. Advantageous features: *9 Shade Settings*1.5 In Extra-wide Slot*Removable Crumb Tray*Cancel/bagel/defrost/reheat Function 9 adjustable browning control Settings 1-3: light shade of toastSettings 4-6: medium shade of toastSettings 7-9: dark shade of toast Package List: 1 X Manual1 X Toast-Color Chart1 X Extra Wide Slot Toaster","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zBIxbZm5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hommater","source_asin":"B0BXJJX5KP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-436427","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXJJX5KP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXJJX5KP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":436428,"name":"Adjustable Memory Foam Pillow, Soft Natural Cotton Cover Breathable, Ergonomic, Heat Regulating, by Duck & Goose, King Size","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41vaYY9heyL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"Customisable comfort is king Did you know that there are 6 identifiable positions for sleep? We're all different though. We could share a similar sleep position to another person, but a number of other factors come into play too. How tall we are. Our weight. Because we sleep as individuals, it makes sense then that we'd look for comfort that suits our individual needs. Our custom designed memory foam pillow allows you to do just that. Customise your comfort. Adjust it for your neck, back and shoulders so you can create the perfect fit for you. Easy to adapt to your ideal sleeping pose Just unzip the pillow cover and customise the filling accordingly. Remove and store the filling you don't need - you could even use it as filling for cushions or beanbags. Support where you need it most Our proprietary memory foam is made from a specialised type of foam that inflates after it has been depressed. When you place your head on the pillow, the foam will contour your head and cushion your neck to optimally position your spine. Ideal for those of us who struggle to maintain a good posture and suffer long-term pain Hypoallergenic The World Allergy Organization (WAO) estimates that between 10-40% of the entire world's population suffers from allergies. That's a lot of people! We've developed our memory foam pillow cover from soft natural bamboo so it's completely hypoallergenic and won't irritate any new or existing allergy symptoms. Rest assured that you won't experience any allergies caused by using our pillow ¡§C only supreme comfort and relaxation. Easy to clean and refresh Simply pop the pillow case on a cold gentle wash cycle and tumble dry on a low heat and you're sorted. If you experience any issue or have any questions/suggestions - please don't hesitate to email us directly","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41vaYY9heyL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"D & G THE DUCK AND GOOSE CO","source_asin":"B0718ZPNK5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-436428","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0718ZPNK5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0718ZPNK5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
