window.products.push({"id":436468,"name":"SYLVIA'S SHOP Vintage 8x10 Oval Picture Frame with Mat, Antique Ornate Luxury Photo Frame, Table Top Display and Wall Hanging Home Decor, Old Fashione","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61k-yiTq5cL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","description":"ELEGANT VINTAGE DESIGN: The antique navy blue picture frame 8x10 with artistic Victorian embellishment perfectly showcases your favorite pictures, portrait or art prints. Fits great for any older family photos. It appears aged and antique. The large vintage oval picture frame 8 by 10 is an ideal choice to display your precious memories in your life, and brings extra old-world charm to your home. EXCELENT QUALITY: The antique looking oval frame is sturdy and well made. It is heavy duty of great value. The lovely retro frame is made of environmental resin, including black velvet backing. The cute frame comes with a solid easel back for table top display and a hook for the option to hang on the wall. Real glass front gives a clear view of your picture and preserves the life of your photo. ATTRACTIVE LOOK: The beautiful frame is hand crafted in gorgeous navy blue and gold colors. It looks warm and appealing. Special vintage oval appearance with perfect details. Outline border dimensions are 9.5x11.5 inch and made to display a 8x10 inch oval photo. It will light your home and make your room look more like a work of art. TABLETOP DISPLAY AND WALL DECOR: This timeless and classy big picture frame 8”x10” stands up wonderfully, and really dresses up the table. It also hangs up vertically, adds a sense of luxury to a gallery wall. This unique frame looks great in the living room, kitchen, dining room. It can be placed just about anywhere, from your home to your office, studio or gallery. IDEAL GIFTS: The ornate old fashioned picture frame is a perfect gift for your family, friends, relatives, and someone you love. Makes a great gift idea for multiple occasions: wedding, anniversary, housewarming, birthday, Father’s Day, Mother’s Day, baby showers, Christmas and family events. This fancy frame delightfully combines sentimental value, practical use, and decorative splendor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61k-yiTq5cL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SYLVIA'S SHOP","source_asin":"B0BP25XWV5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-436468","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BP25XWV5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BP25XWV5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
