window.products.push({"id":436499,"name":"Molblly Memory Foam Pillow, Iyee Nature Adjustable Bed Queen Pillows for Sleeping, CertiPUR-US Approved, Adjustable Height Neck Cervical Pillow for Si","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AjPTidh-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"FULLY ADJUSTABLE PILLOW——ADD or REMOVE the middle foam layer to adjust to a perfect loft for your personal sleep position, head size/weight, overall body size/weight, shoulder width (side sleep). This pillow is originally 4.7in (high contour) and 3.9in (low contour); and 3.5in (high contour) and 3.9in (low contour) when the middle layer is removed. PRESSURE RELIEF——Molblly memory foam is known for its supportive comfort and superior pressure relief as it disperses your weight more evenly than traditional pillows. UNIQUE CONTOURED DESIGN provides the right ergonomics to naturally support your head while aligning your neck and shoulders. HIGHLY BREATHABLE COVER ——Our Ultra-Luxurious Kool-Flow Micro-Vented Cover is so SOFT and COMFORTABLE that you will want to use it without a pillowcase. Both the inner and outer cover have a hidden zipper to detach it from the pillow and MACHINE WASHABLE; Do not wash the memory foam core. Our pillow is certified by CertiPUR-US, ISPA (International Sleep Products Association) and OEKO-TEX for durability, performance and content. No formaldehyde, no mercury, lead or heavy metals. 100% WORRY FREE - We are so confident in the quality of our pillow and we offer 30-day satisfaction guarantee. If you are not happy with it for any reason, please contact us. NOTE: Since the pillow is compressed and rolled up in a plastic bag, there may be a natural non-toxic foam odor while unpacking, please leave it on a flat and ventilated area for 24 hours before first use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AjPTidh-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Molblly","source_asin":"B07S1YS69Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-436499","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S1YS69Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S1YS69Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":436500,"name":"Christopher Knight Home Payne Contemporary Channel Stitch Velvet Club Chair, Gray, Dark Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71856Lp75dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Create a sophisticated space in any room of your home by simply adding a sleek club chair of stunning design. Featuring clean tuxedo arm design and stunning channel stitching, this impressive club chair stands as a streamlined statement piece that can change the whole flow of your interior decor, creating an open, clean space. This chair effortlessly ties together smooth velvet upholstery with a beautiful nailhead trim and slim tapered legs to provide delightful comfort and an elegant touch to any room. Includes: One (1) Club Chair Material: Velvet Composition: 100% Polyester Leg Material: Birch Wood Color: Gray Leg Finish: Dark Brown Hand-Crafted Details Assembly Required Dimensions: 30.50 inches deep x 31.50 inches wide x 28.50 inches high Seat Dimensions: 22.75 inches deep x 22.50 inches wide x 19.00 inches high Arm Height: 28.50 inches","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71856Lp75dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Christopher Knight Home","source_asin":"B088723Y8L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-436500","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088723Y8L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088723Y8L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":436501,"name":"Boston International Naughty Better Square Ceramic Trinket Dish, Nun","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.36,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713+0OPVJtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Chock full of fabulously indulgent quotes to live by, naughty betty adds a splash of humor and fun to everyday life! this ceramic trinket dish is great for keeping by the bedside, on the bathroom counter and anywhere else small items might get lost. An ideal gift for almost any woman, these make terrific additions to bridal shower gift bags, bridesmaid gifts, sorority initiation and graduation gifts and more. It was the love and appreciation of fine design, along with the opportunity to create and market well-made, yet affordable products that lead Jonathan Newman and Steven Faulkner to found Boston international (bi) in 1986. In the beginning, bi was a boutique line with beautiful hand-made paper products from smaller suppliers in Italy, Spain, Germany and the UK. Through the years, the company developed and grew. In 1996, Boston international added ideal home range (IHR) to their product mix and very shortly after that, bi began its relationship with new York's metropolitan museum of art. Through the combination of these lines, BI's core group of suppliers and BI's development of proprietary lines and accessories, bi has become a major force in the gift industry today. Currently, bi partners with suppliers and manufacturers from around the globe to bring their vision to the us market and employs more than 50 people in rustic Holliston, Massachusetts, some 25 miles west of Boston. Boston international's philosophy is the same now as it was back in 1986: combine the very best design with the highest quality materials and manufacturing, then add outstanding distribution and unmatched customer service. Currently over 19,000 customers in 11 countries are the beneficiaries of this philosophy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713+0OPVJtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Boston International","source_asin":"B01HUXDZ60","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-436501","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HUXDZ60","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HUXDZ60","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
