window.products.push({"id":436530,"name":"WeCare Mugs : Save Our Planet : Tanzanite Blue 30oz Stainless Steel Tumbler, Double Wall, Vacuum Insulated Travel mug with Splash Proof Lid, 2 Stainle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81C2G9PDdtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PERFECT GIFT IN A BEAUTIFUL GIFT BOX Perfect for travelers, truck, bus & taxi drivers, teachers, students. You can take this coffee tumbler anywhere: outdoors, sports, traveling, camping, hiking to the mountain, or a trip to the beach. Whether you’re enjoying coffee, tea, hot cocoa or your favorite mocha blend, our stainless steel tumbler will serve you a lifetime. OUR PRODUCT Just as we care about our planet, we put as much effort into our Travel tumblers. 100% Food grade 304 18/8 stainless steel to last a lifetime, no matter what beating you give it. Keep the Heat - Double walled vacuum insulated to keep your coffee nice and hot through the morning. Beat the Heat - Double walled vacuum insulated to keep your drinks cold well past sunset. Cup Holder friendly design to fit most cup holders, making it easy to take wherever the road leads you. OUR TECHNOLOGY DOUBLE WALL VACUUM INSULATED - High tech insulation design prevent heat transfer to the outer walls, keeping your drinks ice-cold for up to 12 hours and your coffee piping hot for up to 8 hours. Our stainless steel tumbler use a SWEAT FREE DESIGN that prevents any temperature changes or condensation from forming on the outside, making sure you never burn yourself again. LASER ETCHING Our coffee tumblers have three Laser etched logos onto a Premium Powder Coat leaving three beautifully hand drawn designed logos, making a statement and a promise. WHATS IN THE BOX A beautiful hand drawn design Save Our Planet Gift Box. 30oz Insulated Tumbler, beautiful laser etched Save our Planet Logo with little “Squirt” our turtle logo on the back of our travel tumbler. A splash-proof lid which is easy to clean and has a second hole for your straw. Reusable Stainless steel straws, two in fact. A straw cleaning brush to keep your straws spotlessly clean. Two spare silicone seals for your lid.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81C2G9PDdtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WeCare Mugs","source_asin":"B0828ZRLCY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-436530","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0828ZRLCY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0828ZRLCY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
