window.products.push({"id":436652,"name":"WiFi Sous-Vide-Machine & Vacuum Sealer Machine, Inkbird Sous Vide Cooker 1000W w/Recipes on APP Precision Cooker | Automatic Air Sous Vide Vacuum Seal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":142.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sfHxfkqAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★ 【What You Get】A wifi sous vide cooker. A PowerVac Air Vacuum Sealer Machine, 5pcs Pre-cut Vacuum Sealer Bag (8\"*11.8\" )&Vacuum Sealer Rolls (8\"*79\" ), Free recipes on the APP and sous vide machine ★ 【Wifi Remote Control】The WIFI sous vide cooker only support 2.4Ghz WIFI, but once the sous vide machine is connected with your router via APP InkbirdPro /InkbirdSmart, you could monitor and control it anywhere you're. Perfectly cooks meals everytime ★ 【Ultraquiet Precision Cooker & Intelligent Design】Inkbird thermal immersion circulator features a wide temperature range of 77-210°F (25-99°C) within 0.1°C accuracy and the max timer setting of 99H; Calibration range: -10F~10F. Keeps a homogeneous temperature for up to 20 L of water even at full 1000 W output; ultra-quiet with less than 40 dB noise at 1 m. Intuitive LCD touch controls allow effortless adjustment and tracking ★ 【Cook Like a Chef at Home】 Achieves restaurant quality meals with ease by preserving juices, moisture and flavors thanks to precise temperature control; low-temperatures sous vide cooking keeps the raw materials fresh, juicy and healthy. If like smoky, could add some barbecue on this basis, a new delicacy will be born, a double feeling.Retains all of the health and nutrition benefits that are difficult to achieve from traditional cooking ★ 【Protection and Temperature Alarm】This thermal cooker will stop working and alarm you when the water level is lower than the minimum. Also will alarm you when temp reaches target setting value. The stainless steel is easy to clean. While this unit is not waterproof. The water level can not over the max line. 【Dry&Moist&Vac Seal&Seal Sealing Modes】---The vacuum air sealer machine kitchen appliance accessories provides more vacuuming modes for different kinds of food, choose an appropriate mode will make the sealed foods taste better. Press the stop button to stop vacuuming at any time and this will make it easier to control the vacuuming time according to the food type. 【10X Longer Preservation】---The powervac vacuum sealers storage removes air from bags and seals them to keep foods fresh and extend the shelf life of them. The vacuum sealing machine preservation time is 10 times the ordinary preservation. Top cooking gadgets for food vacuum sealing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sfHxfkqAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Inkbird","source_asin":"B093PFPLBV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-436652","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093PFPLBV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093PFPLBV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
