window.products.push({"id":436742,"name":"Easycosy Custom Blanket with Photo Personalized Picture Collage Throw Blanket Customized Couples for Family, Mom, Dad 60\"x80\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":48.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91+xOrc7GJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎁Unique & Memorable Blankets: Do you want to make your blanket personal and memorable ? Our personalised blankets for adults can help you create your own from scratch easily! You can custom blanket with picture and text. We have various templates available to pick from. Please click \"Customize Now\" button and upload your satisfying photos, Let this unique and memorable blanket warm you and others you loved. The regular shipping time is 10-15 days, it also can be expedited delivered in 5-7 days. 🎁Warmth & Softness: Our personalised blankets for adults are comfortable and soothing on your skin. This well-stitched flannel provides this personalised photo blanket with a kind of softness, warmth and durability that is not usually found on other blankets. Premium printed pattern features high-quality clarity, sharpness, and color rendering. It is fade-proof, anti-wrinkle and shrink-proof. You can put it into machine, so it s extremely easy to wash and take care of. 🎁Multipurpose Use: Our portable and lightweight item not only can be used as a blanket, but also a bed/sofa throw. When you want to instantly nap or take the chill off while watching TV, it is always super snuggle worthy. It also can be used as a baby blanket, such as a baby swaddle wrap and a nursing cover. Our blanket is machine washable and made of fluffy flannel, enjoying both comfort and ease of use. 🎁Awesome Personalised Gifts for you love: Five different blanket sizes are available. 30\"x40\", 32\"x48\" maybe too small for family home use , but suitable for pets and baby. Personalised photo blanket makes a sweet surprise for family, lovers, friends, baby and pets on the anniversary, Christmas, mother's day or father's day, or for home accessories, and useful fluffs. 🎁Quality Warranty & Satisfaction Guarantee: If you have ANY concerns about your custom blanket with picture, please feel free to contact us and we will resolve the issue immediately. Our blanket can be used for a very long time. Let memory wrap you and people or pets you cherished to feel warm and relaxed!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91+xOrc7GJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Easycosy","source_asin":"B0BW8CQXKF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-436742","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BW8CQXKF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BW8CQXKF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
