window.products.push({"id":436869,"name":"Allen Designs \"Fishy Lips\" Whimsical Pendulum Wall Clock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":56.82,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711BLbPz9bL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"We all read the time now and then, and this wall clock makes it so much fun! Silly and adorable with their big red pouty lips, these fish must be the most popular fish in the sea! The whimsical imagination of Allen Designs brings you an exciting piece of contemporary resin wall art that doubles as a wall clock. It's hand painted in shades of blue and green coated with a protective glossy polyurethane layer to keep the colors bright and shiny. It's 12 inches long, 11 inches high and extends from the wall 2.5 inches. The quartz movement requires just 1 AA battery to set the time and fish pendulum in motion. Hang it in the kitchen, dining room or on any wall you want to bring a little life to. Battery not included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711BLbPz9bL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Allen Designs","source_asin":"B0741DDHSW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-436869","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0741DDHSW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0741DDHSW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
