window.products.push({"id":436877,"name":"Wisesorb 25 Gram 10 Packs Moisture Absorbers, Dehumidifier Bags for Bathrooms, Basements, Rvs, Humidity Packets for Closet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71J1xqdKHvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【High Quality Calcium Chloride Moisture Absorbers Material】: Wisesorb moisture absorbers hanging bags utilize high-quality packaging material specifically designed for calcium chloride, providing excellent breathability and being dust-free. Wisesorb moisture absorbers bag with highly absorbent moisture absorption efficiency up to 400%. The calcium chloride will become gel when combined with water vapor in the air. It is safe and reliable without risk of liquid leakage. 【Fragrance-Free and Ensure No Leakage】: Wisesorb desiccant bags are completely fragrance-free. They not only efficiently dehumidify the area but also prevent the emergence of musty odors caused by excess moisture. They keep the space dry and fresh at all times. You can rest assured that there will be no leakage issues with our bags, as they have undergone pressure testing to ensure their reliability and leak-proof design. 【Ultra Thin and Save Space】: Wisesorb moisture absorbing bags are ultra-thin and space-saving, making them easy to use. Simply lay them in the desired area without taking up much space. Wisesorb moisture absorber bags offer a convenient solution for protecting valuables and clothing from excessive moisture. 【Widely Used】: Moisture absorber packets can be used in various locations, including closets, wardrobes, basements, laundry rooms, households, bathrooms, kitchens, shoe cabinets, cars, cat litter boxes, toolboxes, RVs, campers, and other enclosed spaces. These moisture absorber bags effectively protect your valuables from damage caused by excess moisture and prevent musty smells. Remember to keep the paper side facing up for optimal performance. 【Package Included】: The package includes 10 desiccant bags. Each bag weighs 25g and has a size of 340mm*240mm. The bags are conveniently sealed in a ziplock bag for easy use and storage. You can freely place the moisture absorbing bags in various locations, such as your closet, wardrobes, basement, laundry room, household, bathroom, kitchen, shoe cabinet, car, cat's litter box, and camper. These bags efficiently collect excess humidity to keep your surroundings dry and fresh.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71J1xqdKHvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wisesorb","source_asin":"B0BXKH3QRN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-436877","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXKH3QRN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXKH3QRN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
