window.products.push({"id":436915,"name":"CROMIFY Vacuum Sealer Bags, 100pcs 11\" x 16\" Bags for Food Saver, Seal a Meal, Sous Vide, Food Preservation, BPA Free and Heavy Duty, Commercial Grade","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lucKjJx3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Extended food fresh 5-10 Times Longer：Cromify food sealer bags are specifically designed for vacuum sealing.Great vacuum effect and tight seam can keep freshness up to 5-10 times longer, After sealing，Lock the moisture and freshness of the ingredients, Next time cooking is still very fresh. Food Grade Material and BPA Free：Our vacuum sealer bags are 100 Percent food-safe and BPA free and goes through internationally recognized testing by FDA to ensure that no chemicals will leech into your food. Boil safe, freezer safe and microwave safe, especially for sous vide cooking. Double-side texture design：Cromify vacuum sealer bags adopted Upgraded Composite material PA+PE can block oxygen and moisture and eliminates freezer burn and dehydration. Double-side embossed design maximises channels removes air and better food freshness preservation. with Bone Guards to Prevent Piercing. You can use our vacuum bags with confidence. Wide Compatibility：Fully compatible with all domestic vacuum sealers. Work well with all brands of vacuum sealers. 100 pcs precut vacuum sealer bags. 11” x 16“. Reusable, tear-resistant, reduce food waste and save you money in keeping food fresh or preserve precious items such as jwelry, important documents & auto parts from being damaged or tarnished. Easy to use: Stylish gift box with convenient extractable design allows easily taking out the precut vacuum sealer bags, saving time for preparing make-ahead meals and portioning bulk items in the freezer. It is the best gift for a friend who is good at cooking. We offer lifetime technical support and friendly customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lucKjJx3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cromify","source_asin":"B09NPX7RQK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-436915","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NPX7RQK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NPX7RQK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
