window.products.push({"id":436975,"name":"NEWTRY 7mm Commercial Meat Cutter Machine, Meat Cutting Slicer, Electric Shredder, 850W 330LBS/H, Stainless Steel, for Pork Beef Chicken Breast(with a","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813-lO+CIpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[WHAT DO I NEED TO CONSIDER]---This meat cutter is perfect for boneless fresh meat. Please note that the meat cutting machine can not cut meat with bone, frozen meat, hard vegetables, like carrots, potatoes, etc. The voltage of the commercial meat slicer is 110V US plug. The size of the blade is equal to the thickness of the meat after cutting. This meat shredder has one year warranty under normal use. If you are not sure the size of the blade, please contact us freely. [WHAT ARE THE PARAMETERS]---Machine capacity:330lb/h; Feed port:110X70mm (4.3’’X2.75’’); Product weight:45lb; Motor power: 850W; Product materials: all 304 stainless steel; Voltage: 110V US plug; Gear: ABS plastic gear to reduce noise and stainless steel gear to enhance power. [HOW TO CLEAN THE MACHINE]---Please cut some soft vegetables until the vegetables are clean before first use since there is protective oil on the blade. Please clean the commercial meat cutter after each use. Pour water directly to clean the blade, please don’t wash the motor. Use the water gun in the package to flush out the stuck minced meat on the blade. Apply some cooking oil on the blade after cleaning. [HOW TO CUT MEAT INTO STRIPS AND CUBES]---850W powerful motor enables the restaurant meat cutter machine to process food efficiently, 330lbs/h. Put the meat chunks into the machine and cut them into slices and then strips and lastly put into machine to cut into minced meat or cubes. We recommend you to choose larger gap blade like 10mm, 15mm if you want cubes. [WIDE APPLICATIONS]---This meat dicer can be used for family and commercial use. Compact design, 11.8’’X11.8’’X13.4, which is perfect for daliy countertop use, taking little space, processing meat in a few minutes. It’s a perfect machine for those who are a meat lover but tired of cutting large amount of meat every time. It’s also a good choice for restaurant use, labor and time saving.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813-lO+CIpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NEWTRY","source_asin":"B08HV85MSW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-436975","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HV85MSW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HV85MSW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
