window.products.push({"id":437000,"name":"Healifty Car Neck Pillow for Driving - 1 Pack Memory Foam Car Headrest Pillow with Breathable & Removable Cover - Car Neck Support for Cervical Pain R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uTu10wDLL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"BREATHABLE MEMORY FOAM - The interior of the car pillow is made of memory foam to comfortably support your head and neck, maintain your correct driving posture and provide you with a comfortable driving experience, please check the thickness of the pillow carefully to make sure it fits you. ERGONOMIC DESIGN - The human neck curve is ergonomically designed to release neck pain and shoulder pressure, professionally designed for sedentary people, the headrest pillow can be used in various scenarios (car seats, gaming chairs, office chairs, etc.). ELASTIC ADJUSTABLE SHOULDER STRAPS - High quality buckles are highly secure on your seat, prevent the car seat pillow from slipping or falling off the seat, provide a fixed support, better support your neck, you can adjust the car headrest height as you want. REMOVABLE COVER - As with most frequently used accessories, this neck pillow for car has the potential to collect stains quickly. Getting these stains off the pad is no hassle at all - its removable cover makes thorough cleaning quick and easy. When the next laundry day arrives, remove the cushion cover and include it in the wash cycle. It can be washed in any machine at any temperature and dried in any dryer. EXTRA COMFORT FOR THE DRIVER - Car seat neck pillow restraints are designed to give you the support that factory-installed head restraints lack. It provides extra support for your neck and head and helps improve driving posture and reduce muscle tension and stress.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uTu10wDLL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Healifty","source_asin":"B086WH1LKB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-437000","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086WH1LKB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086WH1LKB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
